MySQLi for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module mysqli of php82-mysqli, the
same build, with php82-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php82-mysqlnd. The
same files as php82-mysqli: install one of the two.

The module mysqli of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/mysqli.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its
headers in include/php82/php/ext/mysqli.
